{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726430/extras/steampage-gif-title-800x400.gif?t=1748252587\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Relive the last day of Pompeii in this adventure puzzle game! </strong>Decipher Mercury\u2019s message by helping the townspeople solve their mysterious problems and escape the eruption of Mount Vesuvius.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this Demo, play the first two missions in full, complete several side quests and collect the points of interest to learn more about daily life in ancient Rome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726430/extras/steampage-gif-run-1_800x250-min.gif?t=1748252587\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726430/extras/EN__2.Decouvre_.png?t=1748252587\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore the faithfully recreated streets of Pompeii.</strong> Visit a Roman <i>Domus</i>, walk the Decumanus (the city\u2019s main street) to meet Aristotle, and stop by the <i>Caupona</i> to help Ascula, the owner, calm her worried clients. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726430/extras/steampage-gif-locations-3_800x250-min.gif?t=1748252587\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726430/extras/EN__3.Apprend_.png?t=1748252587\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Discover the daily life of the Romans. </strong>Complete side quests across the Decumanus to reveal the story of its people and unlock all educational insights created by experts from Institut le Rosey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726430/extras/steampage-gif-PI_800x250-min.gif?t=1748252587\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Demo Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a <i>Domus</i>, a <i>Caupona</i>, and walk the famous Decumanus</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">First 2 missions fully available</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Several side quests about Roman daily life</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Earn rewards in sesterces, the currency of the time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Art based on historical sources in a unique comic book style</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726430/extras/steampage-gif-cadran_800x250-min.gif?t=1748252587\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726430/extras/separator.png?t=1748252587\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Recommended Age</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From age 9 and up to fully enjoy the game\u2019s educational content.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Why Pompeii?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Although the eruption of Vesuvius destroyed the city in 79 AD and claimed many lives, it also preserved a part of Roman history for future generations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover this ancient city like never before.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Created by Institut Le Rosey</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This collaborative project was initiated and guided by a Pompeii expert, with contributions from students from Institut le Rosey. They composed the original soundtrack and took part in the game design, visual development, and testing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game was fully funded by the Fondation le Rosey, which receives no profit from its sale. It is developed and published by DNA Studios.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Fondation le Rosey also provides a classroom-ready educational version. Schools and educational institutions can contact <strong>dangerapompei@rosey.ch</strong> to learn more about access conditions specifically available to them.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Well done!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3726430/6d331cff40cce2f341f6bea5445b41f177f280bd.jpg"}],"total":1},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3726430?t=1748252587","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726430/58916c887aa80c2f0ce165437d9369186960804c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748252587","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726430/423e45f9450e4219a6f9a7d46d18bdf6b23b6e3c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748252587","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726430/423e45f9450e4219a6f9a7d46d18bdf6b23b6e3c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748252587","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726430/extras/steampage-gif-title-800x400.gif?t=1748252587\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Relive the last day of Pompeii in this adventure puzzle game! </strong>Decipher Mercury\u2019s message by helping the townspeople solve their mysterious problems and escape the eruption of Mount Vesuvius.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this Demo, play the first two missions in full, complete several side quests and collect the points of interest to learn more about daily life in ancient Rome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726430/extras/steampage-gif-run-1_800x250-min.gif?t=1748252587\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726430/extras/EN__2.Decouvre_.png?t=1748252587\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore the faithfully recreated streets of Pompeii.</strong> Visit a Roman <i>Domus</i>, walk the Decumanus (the city\u2019s main street) to meet Aristotle, and stop by the <i>Caupona</i> to help Ascula, the owner, calm her worried clients. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726430/extras/steampage-gif-locations-3_800x250-min.gif?t=1748252587\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726430/extras/EN__3.Apprend_.png?t=1748252587\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Discover the daily life of the Romans. </strong>Complete side quests across the Decumanus to reveal the story of its people and unlock all educational insights created by experts from Institut le Rosey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726430/extras/steampage-gif-PI_800x250-min.gif?t=1748252587\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Demo Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a <i>Domus</i>, a <i>Caupona</i>, and walk the famous Decumanus</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">First 2 missions fully available</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Several side quests about Roman daily life</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Earn rewards in sesterces, the currency of the time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Art based on historical sources in a unique comic book style</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726430/extras/steampage-gif-cadran_800x250-min.gif?t=1748252587\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726430/extras/separator.png?t=1748252587\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Recommended Age</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From age 9 and up to fully enjoy the game\u2019s educational content.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Why Pompeii?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Although the eruption of Vesuvius destroyed the city in 79 AD and claimed many lives, it also preserved a part of Roman history for future generations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover this ancient city like never before.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Created by Institut Le Rosey</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This collaborative project was initiated and guided by a Pompeii expert, with contributions from students from Institut le Rosey. They composed the original soundtrack and took part in the game design, visual development, and testing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game was fully funded by the Fondation le Rosey, which receives no profit from its sale. It is developed and published by DNA Studios.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Fondation le Rosey also provides a classroom-ready educational version. Schools and educational institutions can contact <strong>dangerapompei@rosey.ch</strong> to learn more about access conditions specifically available to them.</p>","developers":["DNA Studios"],"fullgame":{"appid":"1592920","name":"Danger in Pompeii"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726430/4a6e9e8d2edb7ef23f987ae4e5a0c99f35470562/header.jpg?t=1748252587","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257135739,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257135739/movie480.mp4?t=1747830555","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257135739/movie_max.mp4?t=1747830555"},"name":"Demo of Danger in Pompei - Trailer EN","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257135739/cd62b97949b1efdc764f10c61b79563493afa375/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1747830555","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257135739/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1747830555","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257135739/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1747830555"}}],"name":"Danger in Pompeii Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2048 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["DNA Studios"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"0","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":false,"date":"26 May, 2025"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steams